<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  The button of the score table (MahjongNextHand, which settles the hand and deals on) in the centre of the table: in the window's centre,
  in the gap that the plate of HandOver leaves for it (the element ButtonGap, 64 high, between the seat rows and the lines). A Screen
  canvas with the settings of HudMenu (match 0.5, minScale 0.6: the 56 unit button is 33.6 px), so it is a touch target in any window. Shown
  and hidden by MahjongHudComponent together with HandOver, which is modal and takes every click that the button does not. It is 56 high at
  22, 176 wide, and its word shrinks (AutoFit): "Следующая раздача" does not fit 176 at 22. The button and the plate are on two scales (the
  canvas follows the window with a floor, the plate follows the fit of the table), so the button is as tall in view units as 56 times the ratio
  of the two, which is 1.0 in a 16:9 window and at most 1.42 in a landscape one of the matrix at user scale 1.0 (32:9): the gap and the two gaps of 8 of the
  plate around it, 80 units, hold that. The button has ignoreSafeArea (a child of the root: the validator lets it) and is anchored to the
  centre, so a notch or side insets do not move it off the gap; y 4 centres it in the gap of the plate (the gap's middle is 6 units
  under the middle of the view).
  In a portrait window (height at least width, 1:1 included) the table is the portrait view, as wide as the window or narrower with bars at the
  sides, and the plate of HandOver is 724 high with a gap of 112 (the variant of that file): the ratio of the two scales reaches 1.6 there (the
  1:1 window of 480 px) and 56 x 1.6 = 90 fits the gap, so the button stays in the middle of the window as in a landscape one. MahjongTouchSizeTest and
  MahjongEndScreenTest hold the place against the plate and the hands in every window of the matrix.
-->
<node name="HandOverAction" layer="26">
  <components>
    <component type="UICanvasComponent" space="Screen" scaleMode="ScaleWithScreen" referenceWidth="1280" referenceHeight="720" match="0.5" minScale="0.6" useSafeArea="true" visible="false">
      <elements>
        <element type="UIButton" name="NextHand" anchor="Center" ignoreSafeArea="true" x="0" y="4" width="176" height="56" text="{handOverButton}" fontSize="22" overflow="AutoFit" minFontSize="12" action="MahjongNextHand" color="40,110,60,255" />
      </elements>
    </component>
  </components>
</node>
